  - 'MISSION OVERVIEW


    "You are trapped in a temporal anomaly across two rooms:
    The Past and The Future.


    Your goal is to bridge the gap of time to find
    the exit. <add more>


    COMMUNICATION IS KEY. Talk to your partner constantly. '
  - 'HOW TO PLAY


    - Identification: Objects you can use will glow with a Yellow
    Outline when you look at them.

    - Interaction: Point your gaze at an object
    and press [X] to interact.

    - Physics: Some items can be picked up and moved.
    Others, like keypads and remotes, will open a menu.

    - Movement: Use the
    joystick to walk. Warning: You cannot pass through solid walls or furniture.'
